Catalan Bijections

This project depends on mathlib and its transitive dependencies. Their original
licenses and attribution notices remain in those packages and are not replaced
by this repository's license.

The mathematical results developed here are classical. In particular, mathlib's
Catalan and DyckWord modules already formalize Catalan counting and an abstract
tree/Dyck-word bijection. See the pinned source links and the dependency boundary
in README.md.
